# F6 test: the stock relative E restore is the default.
#
# With [printer] relative_e_restore left at its default of True,
# RESTORE_GCODE_STATE re-bases the extruder coordinate on the value it had
# when the state was saved, so the next absolute E move is offset by the
# extrusion performed in between and runs past position_max.
DICTIONARY atmega2560.dict
CONFIG homeable_extruder.cfg
SHOULD_FAIL

G28
G92 E0
SAVE_GCODE_STATE NAME=x
G1 E40 F600
RESTORE_GCODE_STATE NAME=x
G1 E45 F600
